Cause LSO on host machine, TSO on VM Ubuntu

Disable LSO on host machine

PS C:\> Get-NetAdapterLso -Name "vEthernet (passthrough)"

Name                           Version         V1IPv4Enabled  IPv4Enabled  IPv6Enabled
----                           -------         -------------  -----------  -----------
vEthernet (passthrough)        LSO Version 2   False          True         True


PS C:\> Disable-NetAdapterLso -Name "vEthernet (passthrough)"
PS C:\> Get-NetAdapterLso -Name "vEthernet (passthrough)"

Name                           Version         V1IPv4Enabled  IPv4Enabled  IPv6Enabled
----                           -------         -------------  -----------  -----------
vEthernet (passthrough)        LSO Version 2   False          False        False


Disable TSO on Ubuntu VM
$ sudo ethtool -k eth0 | grep -E 'tcp-segmentation-offload|tx-tcp-segmentation|tx-tcp6-segmentation'
tcp-segmentation-offload: on
    tx-tcp-segmentation: on
    tx-tcp6-segmentation: on
generic-segmentation-offload: on
$ sudo ethtool -K eth0 tso off
$ sudo ethtool -k eth0 | grep -E 'tcp-segmentation-offload|tx-tcp-segmentation|tx-tcp6-segmentation'
tcp-segmentation-offload: off
    tx-tcp-segmentation: off
    tx-tcp6-segmentation: off
generic-segmentation-offload: on

to make persistent on Ubuntu VM
$ nmcli -f ethtool.feature-tso connection show "Wired connection 1"
$ sudo nmcli connection modify "Wired connection 1" ethtool.feature-tso off
$ nmcli -g ethtool.feature-tso connection show "Wired connection 1"
off
